*Germany advanced to play Mexico (runner-up of [[1998 FIFA World Cup Group E|Group E]]) in the [[1998 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Germany vs Mexico|round of 16]].
*Yugoslavia advanced to play Netherlands (winner of [[1998 FIFA World Cup Group E|Group E]]) in the [[1998 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Netherlands vs Yugoslavia|round of 16]].

